ent-WiredBucketBase = 金屬網桶 | wired bucket
    .desc = 一個附有繫繩的桶子，以便更好地充當下巴帶。 | A bucket with attached wiring to better serve as a chinstrap.
ent-SlicedBucketBase = 切片桶 | sliced bucket
    .desc = 一個桶，側邊切有一道窺視縫。 | A bucket with a vision slit cut into the side.
ent-SteelBucketBase = 鋼製桶 | steel bucket
